- Story & Context: Dr. Aris triggered the first sequence at 3:00 AM, hearing the hum of the cooling fans rise in pitch until the heavy steel bulkhead doors began to vibrate against their hinges, signaling the start of the particle shift. "The math is hungry for something cold," he muttered, clutching a handful of loose wiring while the air tasted sharply of ozone and scorched rubber. A sudden arc of blue light bridged the gap between his console and the main power relay, throwing him against the wall as the music truly began.
